    "turn_text": "No, I've heard you discuss that idea before. I'm all for it. I think that's great. But let's travel back to your junior year of college. A lot of your classmates, I'm sure, this is Princeton University. One of, if not the nation's premier institution of higher learning, many of your classmates, I'm sure, are getting ready to be bankers and going to finance and consulting. But not you. You're getting ready to enter the Marine Corps. And as soon as you graduate, you do just that. Why?",
