    "turn_text": "the Constitution. And so there's enormous value to showing up early. And this is a concept that is near and dear to my heart in Green Bay, Wisconsin, because we have something called Lombardi time. And it's a concept Lombardi stole from Red Lake at West Point when he worked there. And you basically If you're on time, you're 15 minutes late. And it's why the clock at Lambo Field is always 15 minutes",
